<title>CROATIA: Croatian June real wage index 104.3 vs 108.6 May.</title>
<headline>Croatian June real wage index 104.3 vs 108.6 May.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		    JUNE	 MAY	JUNE '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)     104.3	108.6	101.7</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		 1,994	2,067	1,798</p>
<p> -Goods and services sector	1,951	2,036	1,749</p>
<p> -Public sector			2,114	2,149	1,934</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
